# The hero GIF: panels, consensus, a node stop and start, and the palette
# opening the send form.
Source tapes/style.tape
Output hero.gif
Set Framerate 20

Hide
Type "forklab"
Enter
Sleep 5s
Show

Sleep 2s
Down
Sleep 2s
Type "s"
Sleep 1.5s
Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "2"
Sleep 4s
Type "1"
Sleep 1s
Type "S"
Sleep 4s
Type "2"
Sleep 3s
Type "3"
Sleep 2.5s
Ctrl+K
Sleep 800ms
Type "send tokens"
Sleep 1.2s
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Tab
Sleep 800ms
Tab
Sleep 800ms
Type "2500"
Sleep 2.5s
Escape
Sleep 1s
Type "1"
Sleep 1s
Type "c"
Sleep 2.5s
Escape
Sleep 1.5s

Hide
Type "q"
Sleep 500ms
